     "text": "The release download counts are now available: one point one point zero for the x86 build, twelve for ARM. The details are on your screen."
    },
    {
     "t": 92.046,
     "who": "caller",
     "kind": "you",
     "text": "Nice. Can you draft the launch announcement now, with those numbers in it?"
    },
    {
